[CISA advisories] CISA Adds Three Known Exploited Vulnerabilities to Catalog — CISA has added three new vulnerabilities to its Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) Catalog, based on evidence of active exploitation.



CVE-2026-131914 Idunno AntiCsrf Deserialization of Untrusted Data Vulnerability&nbsp;




CVE-2026-132165 Drupal Core Remote Code Execution Vulnerability&nbsp;




CVE-2026-132224 Optimizely Web Experimentation External Control of Critical State Data Vulnerabi

[Computer Weekly] Amazon CTO Werner Vogels: Computing to converge with biology — &lt;p&gt;Technology must decode how biology handles information, because nature handles vast amounts of data with a fraction of the energy used in datacentres.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, security and sovereignty need to be built into systems and software at their inception, and scientists will find new cures for diseases that were unattainable before artificial intelligence (AI).&lt;/p&gt; 
